@gateway = http://localhost:8080
@managerToken = replace-with-signed-access-token
@patientToken = replace-with-signed-patient-access-token
@notificationId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001

### Existing Report API through Gateway -> Support (ADMIN/MANAGER)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/reports/daily?date=2026-10-17
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}

### Existing Notification API; patient must own the notification
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/notifications/{{notificationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{patientToken}}

### Report role must not grant Notification access (MANAGER -> 403)
GET {{gateway}}/api/v1/notifications/{{notificationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{managerToken}}
